host Vultr SEA NixOS VPS ai-jail pier (Daylight DC-1 hand) -- Eastern (EDT)
title Caravan recount -- the reader who reopened a matter is told what the second look came to
prompt Kyri first, then REMEMBER and the itineraries, then the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first on the Microkernel Target double-seat; Standfast on reds; send the increment as its own signed round.
think Standfast first. Every living row in crux/REDS.md reads CLOSED or Released -- %84, %96, %97, and the %81 and %83 preventions all name their proof. No agent-closable red stands, so the constructive queue opens honestly.
think The running thread is the Caravan grievance arc. The newest log (20260820.134309, reweigh) recommends keep-going and names the door in one line: nothing yet tells the reader who reopened the matter that anybody looked at it again, exactly as nothing told a raiser how their quarrel came out until the tidings rung. That is the crux, and it is agent-doable end to end.
think The name is drawn under the Comlink tendency -- clear, fun, safe. recount says both things the rung does: it tells again, and it counts again. Grepped the tree; the only hit is one prose word in caravan/cohort.rye, so nothing seated collides.
think The shape follows the arc's own law. The telling copies the receipt rather than judging a second time, so it carries the same four bytes the reopening carried -- which lets a reader lay the telling beside the word they wrote and see at a glance that the matter answered is the matter they raised.
think The telling lands in the reader's own box, caravan/.readers/desk.knows, rather than under the plan's note directory. That is the whole rung written as a path: every note of this second look so far lived where only a later run of this plan opens it.
think Five refusals, matching the five below. RecountUnlooked is the moment a telling is made at all; RecountUnaddressed is whether anybody is waiting; RecountMismatched is the whole point; RecountMiscounted is the honesty of the count; RecountMisrecorded is the record, read back out of the reader's box rather than out of the memory of writing to it.
think Both measured runs now look again, since the rung below is answered in each. Only whether the reader hears parts them -- so the reweigh numbers stand equal at 1 and 1 while the new number falls 1 to 0.
obs Five RED paths proven on metal before any GREEN claim, each by disarming one guard and rebuilding: skip the write and the run refuses RecountMisrecorded; read the receipt as never standing, RecountUnlooked; read the address as unreachable, RecountUnaddressed; carry some other matter, RecountMismatched; count one look both told and kept, RecountMiscounted.
obs The sixth is the planted control -- the write, the run's read-back, the harness's read, and the provisioning fold's two reads all disarmed at once -- and the selftest printed GREEN while caravan/.readers/desk.knows did not exist at all. Seeing that is what makes the reading back a check rather than decoration.
obs The wire reads what the prose claims: desk.knows holds osrw, the four bytes of the matter echoed back whole, and plan.anew still stands among the plan's own notes, since a telling carries a record outward rather than moving one.
obs Three name collisions surfaced during the build and each was answered by a better name rather than a shorter one: withheld_in and kept_in were both already carried from rungs below, so the count is unsent_looks_in; tell_the_reader was the tidings rung's, so the step is tell_the_reopener. The compiler caught all three, which is the ladder's carried checks doing their job.
obs The ratchet grew as measured: reweigh.rye stood at 15,114 lines and recount.rye stands at 15,664, five hundred and fifty more -- the rate the meter predicted. The fold that would end it still waits on Keaton's word.
obs The council rota doc for this lap was context/RADIANT_STYLE.md with context/TWILIGHT_STYLE.md, item 14, read whole before the first token of this round.
loom rung=caravan_recount lines=15664 elder_lines=15114 growth_lines=550 bytes=720921 checks_red_paths=5 planted_controls=1
loom measure=recount second_looks_made=1 told=1 withheld=0 untold_withholding=1 untold_telling=0 note_bytes=4
file caravan/recount.rye the rung -- the telling, its five refusals, its wire in the reader's own box, and the carried ladder beneath it
file tools/caravan_recount_witness.rish the witness -- the two marks, the refusals by name, and every note read outside the run that wrote it
file tools/caravan_suite_witness.rish registers the new rung in the choir, so it never runs unheard (REDS %81's lesson)
file caravan/README.md the rung's durable record, beside reweigh
file crux/REMEMBER.md the live edge moves to the telling; the prior edge condenses to a pointer
recommend keep-going the arc now corrects a record, carries the correction, hears the answer, records the disagreement, escorts the word, bounds the objection, stands its standing, tells the raiser, reads their reply, carries a live quarrel past the run that heard it, makes the inheriting run answer for it, lets its holder close it, dates it, reads that age aloud, puts a long-standing one before a third hand, reads back what that hand made of it, makes the plan answer that finding on the record, carries the plan's own concession forward, makes the run that inherits it meet it, makes that meeting say what it found, carries that finding home to the reader who won it, reads what that reader makes of it, takes the matter up again when they say it falls short, makes the run that inherits that reopening look, and now carries what the second look found home to the reader who asked. So the question above is what that reader does with the telling -- nothing yet reads whether a second look finally settles the matter, exactly as nothing read a reader's verdict until the suffice rung. Beside it the ladder-copy fold still stands measured and parked at Keaton's word, growing five hundred lines a lap.
